<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= type === "keywords" ? "Keywords" : "Role Titles" %> Generated</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
    }
    .content {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    .success-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #10b981;
      color: white;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <img 
        src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801" 
        alt="CVtoCAREER Logo" 
        style="display: block; margin: 0 auto 16px auto; width: 149px; height: 32px"
        />
    <h1>✅ Process Complete</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="success-badge">SUCCESS</div>
    
    <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
    
    <p>Your CV/Resume has been successfully analyzed and <strong><%= type === "keywords" ? "keywords" : "role titles" %></strong> have been generated automatically.</p>
    
    <p>You can now review and manage these items in your dashboard. Our AI system has identified the most relevant qualifications based on your experience.</p>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Next steps:</strong><br>
      1. Review the generated items in your profile<br>
      2. Approve items you want to keep<br>
      3. Decline items that don't fit your experience
    </p>
    
    <p>Best regards,<br>The C2C Team</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
<p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> C2C. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>